cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Korean Market Data: daily foreign investor flows and KRX sector indices"
abstract: >-
  Daily net buying by investor class for every KOSPI and KOSDAQ common stock
  (2,555 names), plus all 44 Korea Exchange sector indices with returns and
  excess return against their own market. Rebuilt every trading day from
  primary Korean sources and published in English, machine-readable. Settled
  sessions only.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Ju
    given-names: James
    affiliation: K-Export Stars
license: CC-BY-4.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21833374
url: "https://kexportstars.com/tools/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/james-brand/korea-market-data"
